198	1214,1112,1652,1911	198. Berry.	A trailing branch of Cranberry with small oval leaves, and beside it a cranberry cut in two: the upper half on its stalk, the lower half showing the seeds in their cells.
199	70,1499,490,2045	199. Pepo.	A gourd fruit cut across near the top, showing its hard rind and, in the centre, the seeds packed round three placentas.
